sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as ODH Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ModuleOp as MCP Lifecycle<br/>Module Operator
    participant OSApi as OpenShift APIServer CR<br/>config.openshift.io
    participant CM as ConfigMap<br/>odh-mcplifecycleoperator-config
    participant Operand as MCP Lifecycle Operator<br/>(Operand Deployment)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Platform,Operand: Flow 1: Module Operator Reconciliation
        Platform->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Watch event: CR created/updated<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        ModuleOp->>OSApi: GET TLS profile<br/>(config.openshift.io/apiservers)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        OSApi-->>ModuleOp: TLS profile (min version, cipher suites)
        ModuleOp->>CM: GET platformVersion<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        CM-->>ModuleOp: platformVersion value
        Note over ModuleOp: Render manifests:<br/>Inject namespace, image,<br/>TLS config, labels
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: SSA Apply: CRD, Deployment,<br/>RBAC, Service, NetworkPolicy,<br/>ServiceMonitor<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Operand: Deploy/Update operand resources
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Check operand Deployment readiness<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Deployment status (available/progressing)
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: PATCH MCPLifecycleOperator/status<br/>(conditions, releases)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over ModuleOp,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Garbage Collection
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: DiscoveryClient: list API resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Available API resources
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: LIST resources with label<br/>platform.opendatahub.io/part-of:<br/>mcplifecycleoperator<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Labeled resources
        Note over ModuleOp: Compare labeled resources<br/>against desired manifest set
        ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: DELETE stale resources<br/>(not in desired set)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    end
